              <calculation class="tableau" formula="&quot;1  Validate and test product-view-to-cart friction.   2  Run a measured second-purchase lifecycle test.   3  Repair late-January purchase-value tracking before revenue or channel decisions.   Revenue completeness warning: 218 of 321 orders in the week of Jan 25 record $0 revenue.&quot;"/>
